    495  f632							; HotOverlapBody walk. Both read THIS bank, so `lda (FetchPtr),Y` is a plain
    496  f632							; in-bank read — no tramp, no switch, no fold. Entered from ERBlocksPad /
    497  f632							; bank0's HotOverlapFlag pad ($FFEC -> bank2 $FFEF image) and exited through
    498  f632							; ReturnPad.
