    502  f8b7							; C11 (2026-10-21): the "no record stream" sentinel. RoomRectsLo/Hi point here
    503  f8b7							; whenever the room owns no FEATURE records (B3RoomBlocks stages it; only an
    504  f8b7							; extras record with feature cells repoints the pair), so the overscan walk
    505  f8b7							; and the VBL PhaseBlink walk read a $00 count instead of a TIA address.
    506  f8b7				   RoomNoStream
