    509  f8b8							; C5 (2026-10-20): B3RoomBlocks MOVED to the free $F453 window (it grew by
    510  f8b8							; the async-extras dispatch). The window start stays reserved and
    511  f8b8							; HotOverlapBody keeps its $F8F8 address, so nothing downstream shifts.
    512  f8b8		       00 00 00 00*	      .ds	$F8F8 - *, 0
