   1055  fc1d							; C2 (2026-10-20): B3StageBand + M1OffTab (was bank3 $FC38-$FCF2).
   1056  fc1d							; Called from BCFDarkRun (`jmp B3StageBand`) and bank1's HUD fold; ends
   1057  fc1d							; `jmp ReturnPad`. ZP/TIA only — no level-data read.
