   1162  fd1e							; --- No ball in this room → BE the ball gate off. ---------------------
   1163  fd1e							; BandTab is the per-band ENABL gate for the cave (.Row). MetaA bit0 is
   1164  fd1e							; the band-0 gate AND (for a door) the "M1 strip on the RIGHT half"
   1165  fd1e							; flag — a door has no ball, so its bit0 must NOT enable one. Before
   1166  fd1e							; this, the door room rendered a wall-coloured (COLUPF) ball bar over
   1167  fd1e							; the band-0 opening: ENABL on, RESPBL never strobed (Temp=0) → the
