   1204  fd3c							; CollisionCellX/CollisionEndY ($8F scratch — the pack below rebuilds
   1205  fd3c							; it). The PF buffers ARE the collision map (cell walk + laser read
   1206  fd3c							; them) — toggling the cell's two bits THERE makes render + PHM +
   1207  fd3c							; laser follow with zero kernel cost. 64f full cycle = EnemyRamP bit5
   1208  fd3c							; (32 on + 32 off; clock-derived, no state bytes — locked plan).
   1209  fd3c							; --- PhaseBlink ping-pong (chunk A2): it MUST run after the band/ball
   1210  fd3c							; staging above and before the pack below (the crunch walk overwrites
   1211  fd3c							; Temp/BandTab for its cell — running it earlier let SBT's own staging
