   1219  fd3f							; b4-b7 = right_col+1, b0-3 = the four ball band gates, 0 = symmetric.
   1220  fd3f							; When NO band is gated, b3 carries the M1-present flag instead, so an
   1221  fd3f							; M1-ONLY room still packs nonzero (the kernel's OverlayTramp gates on
   1222  fd3f							; LineCount != 0 — no M1 cross otherwise). The two uses cannot collide:
   1223  fd3f							; with a gate set, OvShutBand's mask comes from OvHead/OvTail, and a
   1224  fd3f							; player box in band 3 matches b3 only when a band-3 strip is drawn.
